          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Section 12A (read with Section 12AB post-2020) requires charitable trusts, societies, and Section 8 companies to register with the Income Tax Department to claim income tax exemption under Sections 11 and 12. Without 12A, the NGO's surplus income is taxed at normal rates. Registration is via Form 10A (provisional) or Form 10AB (regular/renewal)."
