                <p><strong>Governing Provisions:</strong></p><ul><li>Section 12A/12AB, Income Tax Act 1961 - Registration for income tax exemption. All registrations time-bound post-Finance Act 2020.</li><li>Sections 11 & 12 - Grant actual exemption. Section 11 for trust property income. Section 12 for voluntary contributions (donations).</li><li>Section 2(15) - Defines charitable purpose: relief of poor, education, yoga, medical relief, environment preservation, general public utility.</li><li>Form 10A - Provisional (3 years). Form 10AB - Regular/renewal (5 or 10 years).</li><li>2025 Amendment - 10-year validity for small trusts with income &le; Rs 5 Cr. Cancellation only for false information.</li><li>ITR-7 - Annual return for charitable trusts. Form 10BD - Statement of donations by May 31.</li><li>Section 135, Companies Act 2013 - CSR mandate. 12A required for CSR fund eligibility.</li></ul><p><strong>Key Portal:</strong> <a href="https://incometax.gov.in" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Income Tax E-Filing Portal (incometax.gov.in)</a></p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

